---
// <KinshipLattice> — the family list on the public Sahyog Vivran page (Story 11b.5a; `2026-10-31-428` item 1, Trustee-ratified:
// relation + name, the fourteen relations, used for nothing else; build decision `-431` KL2 / KL10).
// ⭐ UX §11: a two-column label/value list — ⛔ a family tree, ⛔ lines, ⛔ avatars, ⛔ a social graph (11a.3's invariant). A semantic
// `<dl>` labelled by its own heading, so a screen reader announces the pairs (English: *"Wife: Sunita Devi, Sons: Amit, Rahul"* —
// a plural label where the relation has one and the row holds two or more names — ten of the fourteen do; Wife / Husband / Father /
// Mother keep the singular — the names joined by `, `, ⛔ no "and").
// ⭐ Dumb: it asks the matrix ⛔ nothing and decides ⛔ nothing — `planFamilyMemorial` gates it and `kinshipLatticeRows` labels the
// rows; it renders what it is given through `{}` interpolation (⛔ `set:html`). Each `<dd dir="auto">` isolates its ROW; the API
// ran each NAME through `isolateMemorialBidi`, which wraps only a name holding a direction CONTROL (RP34 — a right-to-left-script
// name with none is drawn as is, and as a row's FIRST name it sets the `<dd>` right-to-left: RD19). Spacing only, as static inline token styles here (⛔ a styled wrapper in `FamilyMemorial.astro` — its
// exact-three-styles pin), ⛔ a class (`apps/public` has ⛔ Tailwind pipeline — 11b.5 MV5), ⛔ a `<style>`.
// ⭐ Body-only: ⛔ nothing here reaches <head>, Open Graph, a share card or a sitemap. ⛔ No `lang` (the family's language is ⛔ recorded).
import type { KinshipLatticeRow } from '../lib/family-memorial.js';

interface Props {
  heading: string;
  rows: readonly KinshipLatticeRow[];
}

const { heading, rows } = Astro.props;
---
<h3 id="sv-family-kinship-heading" style="margin: var(--space-row) 0 0;">{heading}</h3>
<dl data-field="family_memorial_kinship" aria-labelledby="sv-family-kinship-heading" style="margin: var(--space-row) 0 0;">
  {rows.map((row) => (
    <div style="margin: var(--space-row) 0 0;">
      <dt>{row.label}</dt>
      <dd dir="auto" style="margin: 0;">{row.names}</dd>
    </div>
  ))}
</dl>
